  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759152,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100 Classic Games for Nintendo DS: A Timeless Collection\n\nRelive the golden age of gaming with *100 Classic Games* for the Nintendo DS! This definitive compilation brings together a staggering variety of beloved board, card, puzzle, and tabletop games, offering endless hours of entertainment for players of all ages and skill levels. \n\nChallenge yourself with strategic classics like Chess and Texas Hold'Em, test your logic with Sudoku and Mahjongg, or enjoy the quick-fire fun of Match-3 and Spot The Difference.  From the precision of Air Hockey to the addictive nature of slot machines and the patience required for Klondike and Freecell solitaire, there’s something for everyone. \n\nUtilize the Nintendo DS's touch screen for intuitive gameplay and enjoy the portability of having a vast game library in your pocket.  Perfect for travel, family gatherings, or a relaxing evening, *100 Classic Games* is a timeless collection that celebrates the enduring appeal of classic games. Rediscover old favorites and introduce new generations to these enduring entertainment staples!"
    },
